  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Ruben**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **White Freightliner**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Wild Horses**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-09-21.ycoop** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 103 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Set I, Set II [1]\n- A recorder malfunction lost the rest of the set, so the recording is incomplete [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-09-21.ycoop**: taped by ycoop; source: Source 1: Avantone CK1 Hypers (DINa) > DR-60d mkII Source 2: AT853 omnis (~1m split) > CA9100 > DR-60d mkII [1]. Also: Yoni Cooperman taped and mixed it, using two sources: Avantone CK1 Hypers (DINa) and AT853 omnis about one meter apart, both into a DR-60d mkII [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Independent - San Francisco, CA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/the-independent-san-francisco-ca-2/) [3]",
